        dct:description "entrainment lambda 1.939 mm versus unbiased 2.216 mm — datasets/cornus_controversa_turing_wavelength_s0/cornus_controversa_turing_wavelength_s0_metrics.json: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-cornus-controversa-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, application/json, 4769 B, artifact_sha256 7b630848827e99ff76af194106422be7d906d4651e2a614a57bade202a652f49 (sha256 7b630848827e99ff76af194106422be7d906d4651e2a614a57bade202a652f49), spec_fingerprint 889436d47b7f6a20b524144198f645dcccbc348d99fd9ce666f715dfafc2a48a" .
